 Illiquid Asset Cap: Assets with bid-ask spread >2% or days-to-liquidate >30 are illiquid; capped at 10%.
 LCR Requirement: Liquidity Coverage Ratio must remain above 100% at all times; breach triggers immediate notification.
 Stress Test Frequency: Monthly liquidity stress tests required for all High and Medium risk portfolios.
 Redemption Reserves: Funds expecting quarterly redemptions >5% of NAV must hold equivalent cash reserves.
 Liquidity Ladder: Portfolio must maintain tiered liquidity across 1-day, 7-day, 30-day, and 90-day buckets.
